# Contract Naming

FE schema/type, service params, API request/response, BE DTO, DB fields, relationships, pivot payloads — **same keys**, same nested shape.

Cross-repo check only when `team-projects` config maps `contract.frontend` + `contract.backend`; else check current workspace only and say FE↔BE cross-repo is unavailable.

- No rename-only mapping layers (`content` stays `content`, not `content_blog`).
- No flattening `auth: { id, name }` → `auth_id`, `auth_name`.
- M-N/pivot under relationship keys. Third-party legacy mapping only at adapter boundary with documented reason.

```ts
// Good: { content, auth: { id, name } }
// Bad:  { content_blog, auth_id, auth_name }
```
